align=\"center\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">집단</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 77.89pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 19.48pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이성관계 증진</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 266.28pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 19.48pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">여성과 남성의 차이를 이해하여 건강하고 긍정적인 이성관계 도모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: null\"> </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3. 모집기간 </strong></p><p>- <font color=\"#f15f5f\"><strong>2014년&nbsp;9월 22일(화) ~ 10월 2일(목) 18시까지 </strong></font></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4. 모집인원 </strong></p><p>-&nbsp; 각 집단별 10명씩 (선착순)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>5. 신청방법</strong></p><p>-&nbsp; 방문신청&nbsp;상담지도센터(학생회관 201호)&nbsp;</p></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><strong>6.&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">집단기간 </span></strong></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">2014년 10월 6일(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">) ~ 10월 23일(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">【</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">회기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">, 2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">】 </span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #cedeef; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; WIDTH: 79.37pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 25.14pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">회기</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #cedeef; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 79.37pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 25.14pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\